        "view": {
          "intent": "node",
          "payload": "node.web.detail",
          "scroll": "page"
        },
        "semanticLevel": "detail",
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='container-type:inline-size;width:100%;height:100%'><div style='box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif;padding:4cqw;border-radius:1cqw;background:#f4edf9;border-top:1.2cqw solid #7543a4;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2cqw'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:2cqw'><div style='min-width:0'><div style='font-size:2.2cqw;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7543a4'>Collection</div><div style='font-weight:600;font-size:4cqw;line-height:1.2;color:#0f172a;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis'>Templates</div></div><div style='font-size:2.2cqw;color:#64748b;white-space:nowrap'>3 graphs</div></div><div style='flex:1;min-height:0;overflow:auto'><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(26.2cqw,1fr));gap:1.4cqw;align-content:start'><a href='tlz://twilite.zone/library/templates/page-template/root.node' style='display:flex;gap:2.2cqw;align-items:flex-start;box-sizing:border-box;height:14.2cqw;padding:1.6cqw 2.1cqw;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#f4edf9;border-left:.65cqw solid #a63129;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;min-width:0;overflow:hidden'><span style='flex:none;width:6.2cqw;height:6.2cqw;border-radius:1.6cqw;background:#a6312922;color:#a63129;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:600;font-size:3cqw'>P</span><span style='min-width:0'><span style='display:block;font-weight:800;font-size:3.3cqw;line-height:1.25;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;color:#0f172a'>Page Template</span><span style='display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden;font-size:2.6cqw;line-height:1.3;color:#64748b'>Draft for the Page Template.  It is intended to provide a working background upon which to place a set of nodes.</span></span></a><a href='tlz://twilite.zone/library/templates/task-template/root.node' style='display:flex;gap:2.2cqw;align-items:flex-start;box-sizing:border-box;height:14.2cqw;padding:1.6cqw 2.1cqw;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#f4edf9;border-left:.65cqw solid #b91c1c;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;min-width:0;overflow:hidden'><span style='flex:none;width:6.2cqw;height:6.2cqw;border-radius:1.6cqw;background:#b91c1c22;color:#b91c1c;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:600;font-size:3cqw'>T</span><span style='min-width:0'><span style='display:block;font-weight:800;font-size:3.3cqw;line-height:1.25;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;color:#0f172a'>Task Template</span><span style='display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden;font-size:2.6cqw;line-height:1.3;color:#64748b'>A task is a graph with one goal, its work items and its open questions. Its views are derived from them, so its status is readable without opening it.</span></span></a><a href='tlz://twilite.zone/library/templates/declaration-template/root.node' style='display:flex;gap:2.2cqw;align-items:flex-start;box-sizing:border-box;height:14.2cqw;padding:1.6cqw 2.1cqw;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#f4edf9;border-left:.65cqw solid #294b83;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;min-width:0;overflow:hidden'><span style='flex:none;width:6.2cqw;height:6.2cqw;border-radius:1.6cqw;background:#294b8322;color:#294b83;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:600;font-size:3cqw'>D</span><span style='min-width:0'><span style='display:block;font-weight:800;font-size:3.3cqw;line-height:1.25;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;color:#0f172a'>Declaration Template</span><span style='display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden;font-size:2.6cqw;line-height:1.3;color:#64748b'>What a new graph looks like: a page that explains each part of a Declaration and walks you through building one, laid out the way a graph should be.</span></span></a></div></div></div></div>"
